{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "tasks/an-inline-delegation-runs-its-agent-in-a-child-room",
  "title": "An inline delegation creates a child room in the parent's organization, its agent attached, tells it the task as a system message only intelligence reads, keeps its answer as the room's trace, and ends the task with that answer: the parent's hooks, the status bus and the child room say how it ended",
  "rules": [
    "§23.3 step 1",
    "§23.3 step 2",
    "§23.3 step 4",
    "§23.3 step 5",
    "§23.3 step 6",
    "§23.3 step 7",
    "§23.5",
    "§19.8",
    "§17.2"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/tasks/test_integration.py::test_full_delegate_flow, test_child_metadata_envelope_copied_to_child_room; tests/tasks/test_delegation_organization.py; tests/tasks/test_child_room_trace.py; tests/test_task_status.py::test_a_delegation_posts_pending_then_completed_with_its_task (each entry names the task, $e1 as any id of no timeline). core/mixins/delegation.py _open_child_room, _announce_task, _complete_inline; tasks/status.py post_task_pending, post_task_ended; tasks/_child_status.py record_task_end. The parent room's _child_metadata envelope is copied onto the child room and stamped again; the delegation's keys are written last.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "worker",
        "type": "ai",
        "category": "intelligence",
        "on_event": [
          {
            "when": {
              "text": "Summarize the call."
            },
            "respond": [
              {
                "content": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "body": "Summary."
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "room-1",
        "organization_id": "acme",
        "metadata": {
          "_child_metadata": {
            "tenant": "t-7"
          }
        },
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "hooks": [
      {
        "name": "delegated",
        "trigger": "on_task_delegated",
        "execution": "async"
      },
      {
        "name": "completed",
        "trigger": "on_task_completed",
        "execution": "async"
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "delegate",
      "room_id": "room-1",
      "agent_id": "worker",
      "task": "Summarize the call.",
      "wait": true,
      "context": {
        "ticket": "T-1"
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "id": "$e1",
          "child_room_id": "$r1",
          "parent_room_id": "room-1",
          "agent_id": "worker",
          "task": "Summarize the call.",
          "description": "Summarize the call.",
          "hand_back": "relay",
          "status": "completed",
          "result": {
            "task_id": "$e1",
            "child_room_id": "$r1",
            "parent_room_id": "room-1",
            "agent_id": "worker",
            "status": "completed",
            "output": "Summary.",
            "error": null,
            "metadata": {
              "ticket": "T-1"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    },
    {
      "call": "status.recent",
      "agent_id": "worker",
      "expect": {
        "result": [
          {
            "agent_id": "worker",
            "action": "task",
            "status": "pending",
            "detail": "Summarize the call.",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "room-1",
              "task_id": "$e1",
              "child_room_id": "$r1"
            }
          },
          {
            "agent_id": "worker",
            "action": "task",
            "status": "completed",
            "detail": "Summary.",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "room-1",
              "task_id": "$e1",
              "child_room_id": "$r1",
              "task_status": "completed",
              "duration_ms": {
                "$present": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "rooms": {
      "$r1": {
        "organization_id": "acme",
        "metadata": {
          "tenant": "t-7",
          "_child_metadata": {
            "tenant": "t-7"
          },
          "parent_room_id": "room-1",
          "task_id": {
            "$present": true
          },
          "task_agent_id": "worker",
          "task_input": "Summarize the call.",
          "task_context": {
            "ticket": "T-1"
          },
          "task_status": "completed",
          "task_result": "Summary."
        }
      }
    },
    "bindings": {
      "$r1": {
        "worker": {
          "category": "intelligence"
        },
        "sms": null
      }
    },
    "timeline": {
      "room-1": [],
      "$r1": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "message",
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "system",
            "channel_type": "system"
          },
          "visibility": "intelligence",
          "status": "delivered",
          "chain_depth": 0,
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Summarize the call."
          }
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "message",
          "source": {
            "channel_id": "worker"
          },
          "status": "delivered",
          "chain_depth": 1,
          "content": {
            "type": "text",
            "body": "Summary."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "turns": {
      "$r1": {
        "worker": [
          {
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "system"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "Summarize the call."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "hooks": {
      "delegated": [
        {
          "trigger": "on_task_delegated",
          "room_id": "room-1",
          "event": {
            "type": "task_delegated",
            "room_id": "room-1",
            "visibility": "internal",
            "status": "delivered",
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "worker",
              "channel_type": "ai"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "[Task delegated to worker] Summarize the call."
            },
            "metadata": {
              "task_id": {
                "$present": true
              },
              "child_room_id": "$r1",
              "parent_room_id": "room-1",
              "agent_id": "worker",
              "task_input": "Summarize the call."
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "completed": [
        {
          "trigger": "on_task_completed",
          "room_id": "room-1",
          "event": {
            "type": "task_completed",
            "room_id": "room-1",
            "visibility": "internal",
            "status": "delivered",
            "source": {
              "channel_id": "worker",
              "channel_type": "ai"
            },
            "content": {
              "type": "text",
              "body": "Summary."
            },
            "metadata": {
              "task_id": {
                "$present": true
              },
              "child_room_id": "$r1",
              "parent_room_id": "room-1",
              "agent_id": "worker",
              "task_status": "completed",
              "duration_ms": {
                "$present": true
              },
              "error": {
                "$absent": true
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
